<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>The <ref refid="Bpv7Crc_8h" kindref="compound">Bpv7Crc.h</ref> file contains software methods for computing the CRC16 for Bundle Protocol Version 7 and contains both software and hardware methods for computing the CRC32C for Bundle Protocol Version 7. </para>
</sect1>
